#. A short description of the game for search results, link previews and an installed app.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.description"
msgid "A nation game on the real Earth: 196 countries, one save file, and every government run by the players in it. In closed alpha."
msgstr "Igra o državama na pravoj Zemlji: 196 država, jedna zajednička sačuvana igra i svaku vladu vode igrači. U zatvorenoj alfi."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.expanded.breaks"
msgid "**Things will break.** That is what this is for. Tell us on Discord."
msgstr "**Stvari će se kvariti.** Zbog toga ovo i postoji. Javi nam na Discordu."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.expanded.deleted"
msgid "**The world will be deleted when the alpha ends.** Every citizen, company, bank, party and government goes with it. We are saying so now rather than afterwards, because finding out afterwards is how a test loses its testers."
msgstr "**Svet će biti obrisan kad se alfa završi.** S njim nestaju svi građani, firme, banke, stranke i vlade. Kažemo to odmah, a ne naknadno, jer test gubi testere upravo kad oni to saznaju tek naknadno."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.expanded.heading"
msgid "This is a closed alpha, and it is not the real thing yet."
msgstr "Ovo je zatvorena alfa i još nije prava igra."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.expanded.waits"
msgid "**Some waits are much shorter than they will be.** Founding a company, changing your name, changing citizenship, calling an election: several of these normally take days or weeks, and have been compressed so that a short test can reach them at all. They are not the real numbers and they will go back up."
msgstr "**Neka čekanja su mnogo kraća nego što će biti.** Osnivanje firme, promena imena, promena državljanstva, raspisivanje izbora: nekoliko njih obično traje danima ili nedeljama, a skraćena su da bi ih kratak test uopšte mogao da dostigne. To nisu prave vrednosti i biće ponovo povećana."

#. The first of the two lines of the entry card's headline.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.headline.first"
msgid "One world. One citizen."
msgstr "Jedan svet. Jedan građanin."

#. The second of the two lines of the entry card's headline.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.headline.second"
msgid "This alpha is deleted when it ends."
msgstr "Ova alfa se briše kad se završi."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.howLong"
msgid "This is a closed alpha, and **the world will be deleted when it ends.** Your citizen, its history and everything it owned go with it. Your account and email address are deleted too, unless you ask us to keep them so you can come back."
msgstr "Ovo je zatvorena alfa i **svet će biti obrisan kad se završi.** Tvoj građanin, njegova istorija i sav njegov imetak nestaju s njim. Brišu se i tvoj račun i adresa e-pošte, osim ako zatražiš da ih sačuvamo kako bi ti ostala mogućnost da se vratiš."

#. The name of this stage of the game, on a small badge. Keep it short.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.mark"
msgid "Closed alpha"
msgstr "Zatvorena alfa"

#. Said first in the banner while the next world is on its way.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.nextWorld"
msgid "A public alpha is coming, open to anybody. When it opens, this world is deleted and everybody starts again. Discord will say when."
msgstr "Dolazi javna alfa, otvorena za sve. Kad se otvori, ovaj svet se briše i svi počinju iz početka. Kad, javljamo na Discordu."

#. The small label over the titles of the Terms and the privacy note.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.eyebrow"
msgid "Closed alpha"
msgstr "Zatvorena alfa"

#. A page description for the privacy note, for search results.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.privacyDescription"
msgid "What Gray Horizon keeps about you during the closed alpha, where it is kept, how long it is held, and how to have it deleted."
msgstr "Šta Gray Horizon čuva o tebi tokom zatvorene alfe, gde se to čuva, koliko dugo i kako da se obriše."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.privacyScope"
msgid "This says what Gray Horizon keeps about you, where it is kept and how to have it deleted. It covers the closed alpha, and it was last updated on 29 September 2026."
msgstr "Ovde piše šta Gray Horizon čuva o tebi, gde se to čuva i kako da se obriše. Odnosi se na zatvorenu alfu, a poslednji put je ažurirano 29. septembra 2026."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.termsDeck"
msgid "These are the plain-language terms of a hobby project, written by the person who runs it rather than by a lawyer. The version above is the one recorded against your account when you registered, and it was last updated on 16 September 2026."
msgstr "Ovo su uslovi jednog hobi projekta, napisani jednostavnim jezikom, a napisala ih je osoba koja ga vodi, a ne advokat. Verzija iznad je ona koja je zabeležena uz tvoj račun pri registraciji, a poslednji put je ažurirana 16. septembra 2026."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.termsDeleted.first"
msgid "Every citizen, company, bank, party, government, war and article goes with it. **Nothing you build here is kept.** This is said in the banner inside the game, in the invitation that brought you here, and again now, because finding out afterwards is how a test loses its testers."
msgstr "Svi građani, firme, banke, stranke, vlade, ratovi i članci nestaju s njim. **Ništa što ovde izgradiš ne ostaje.** To piše na baneru u igri, u pozivu koji te je doveo ovamo i sada ponovo, jer test gubi testere upravo kad oni to saznaju tek naknadno."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.termsDeleted.second"
msgid "Some waits are also much shorter than they will be. Founding a company, changing your name, changing citizenship and calling an election normally take days or weeks, and have been compressed so that a short test can reach them at all. Those are not the real numbers."
msgstr "Neka čekanja su takođe mnogo kraća nego što će biti. Osnivanje firme, promena imena, promena državljanstva i raspisivanje izbora obično traju danima ili nedeljama, a skraćena su da bi ih kratak test uopšte mogao da dostigne. To nisu prave vrednosti."

#. A page description for the Terms, for search results.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.termsDescription"
msgid "What Gray Horizon is, who runs it, that the world is deleted when the closed alpha ends, and how an account is closed."
msgstr "Šta je Gray Horizon, ko ga vodi, da se svet briše kad se zatvorena alfa završi i kako se račun zatvara."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.closed.pages.termsWhatThis"
msgid "It is in closed alpha, which means invited testers and a game that is still being built. It is given to you exactly as it is. Nothing here promises that it will be running at any particular moment, or that what you do in it will work. **Things will break.** That is what a test is for, and saying so when they do is the reason you were invited."
msgstr "Igra je u zatvorenoj alfi, što znači pozvani testeri i igra koja se još pravi. Daje ti se baš onakva kakva jeste. Ništa ovde ne obećava da će raditi u bilo kom trenutku, niti da će ono što u njoj radiš da funkcioniše. **Stvari će se kvariti.** Zbog toga test i postoji, a upravo zato te pozivamo: da nam javiš kad se to desi."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
