msgctxt "stage.public.expanded.waits"
msgid "**The waits are the real ones.** Founding a company needs an account a week old, except in a country that is still new: there it needs no waiting, and newcomers vote at once."
msgstr "**Čekanja su prava.** Za osnivanje firme potreban je račun star nedelju dana, osim u državi koja je još nova: tamo nema čekanja, a pridošlice glasaju odmah."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.expanded.why"
msgid "We deleted the closed alpha and started again, open to anybody, so we can see whether the rules and the economy hold up with more people in them."
msgstr "Obrisali smo zatvorenu alfu i počeli iz početka, otvoreno za sve, da bismo videli da li pravila i ekonomija izdržavaju sa više ljudi u njima."

#. The first of the two lines of the entry card's headline.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.headline.first"
msgid "One world. One citizen."
msgstr "Jedan svet. Jedan građanin."

#. The second of the two lines of the entry card's headline.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.headline.second"
msgid "This alpha is deleted before the beta."
msgstr "Ova alfa se briše pre bete."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.howLong"
msgid "This world is a public alpha, and **it will be deleted before the beta opens.** Your citizen, its history and everything it owned go with it. Your account and email address are deleted too, unless you ask us to keep them so you can come back. We will say when at least two weeks ahead."
msgstr "Ovaj svet je javna alfa i **biće obrisan pre otvaranja bete.** Tvoj građanin, njegova istorija i sav njegov imetak nestaju s njim. Brišu se i tvoj račun i adresa e-pošte, osim ako zatražiš da ih sačuvamo kako bi ti ostala mogućnost da se vratiš. Javićemo kad, najmanje dve nedelje unapred."

#. The name of this stage of the game, on a small badge. Keep it short.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.mark"
msgid "Public alpha"
msgstr "Javna alfa"

#. The small label over the titles of the Terms and the privacy note.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.eyebrow"
msgid "Public alpha"
msgstr "Javna alfa"

#. A page description for the privacy note, for search results.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.privacyDescription"
msgid "What Gray Horizon keeps about you during the public alpha, where it is kept, how long it is held, and how to have it deleted."
msgstr "Šta Gray Horizon čuva o tebi tokom javne alfe, gde se to čuva, koliko dugo i kako da se obriše."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.privacyKept"
msgid "The deleted closed alpha world's last copy is kept for 30 days after the public alpha opens, and then deleted too."
msgstr "Poslednja kopija obrisanog sveta iz zatvorene alfe čuva se 30 dana nakon otvaranja javne alfe, a zatim se i ona briše."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.privacyScope"
msgid "This says what Gray Horizon keeps about you, where it is kept and how to have it deleted. It covers the public alpha, and it was written when the public alpha opened."
msgstr "Ovde piše šta Gray Horizon čuva o tebi, gde se to čuva i kako da se obriše. Odnosi se na javnu alfu, a napisano je kad se javna alfa otvorila."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.termsDeck"
msgid "These are the plain-language terms of a hobby project, written by the person who runs it rather than by a lawyer. The version above is the one recorded against your account when you registered, and it was written for the public alpha."
msgstr "Ovo su uslovi jednog hobi projekta, napisani jednostavnim jezikom, a napisala ih je osoba koja ga vodi, a ne advokat. Verzija iznad je ona koja je zabeležena uz tvoj račun pri registraciji, a napisana je za javnu alfu."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.termsDeleted.first"
msgid "Every citizen, company, bank, party, government, war and article goes with it. **Nothing you build here is kept.** This is said in the banner inside the game, on the front page, and again now, before you build anything. The date is given at least two weeks ahead."
msgstr "Svi građani, firme, banke, stranke, vlade, ratovi i članci nestaju s njim. **Ništa što ovde izgradiš ne ostaje.** To piše na baneru u igri, na početnoj stranici i sada ponovo, pre nego što išta izgradiš. Datum se objavljuje najmanje dve nedelje unapred."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.termsDeleted.second"
msgid "The waits are the real ones, the same as they will be in the beta."
msgstr "Čekanja su prava, ista kao što će biti u beti."

#. A page description for the Terms, for search results.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.termsDescription"
msgid "What Gray Horizon is, who runs it, that the world is deleted before the beta opens, and how an account is closed."
msgstr "Šta je Gray Horizon, ko ga vodi, da se svet briše pre otvaranja bete i kako se račun zatvara."

#. Words between ** and ** are drawn in bold: keep the markers around the matching words.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.pages.termsWhatThis"
msgid "It is in public alpha, which means anybody can join a game that is still being built. It is given to you exactly as it is. Nothing here promises that it will be running at any particular moment, or that what you do in it will work. **Things will break.** That is what an alpha is for, and saying so when they do is how it gets better."
msgstr "Igra je u javnoj alfi, što znači da svako može da se pridruži igri koja se još pravi. Daje ti se baš onakva kakva jeste. Ništa ovde ne obećava da će raditi u bilo kom trenutku, niti da će ono što u njoj radiš da funkcioniše. **Stvari će se kvariti.** Zbog toga alfa i postoji, a kad nam javiš da se to desilo, igra postaje bolja."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.permanence"
msgid "Your citizen lasts until the beta, when this public alpha world is deleted."
msgstr "Tvoj građanin traje do bete, kad se ovaj svet javne alfe briše."

#. The one line of the banner on a phone. Keep it short.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.phone"
msgid "Public alpha: deleted before the beta"
msgstr "Javna alfa: briše se pre bete"

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.previousWorld.body"
msgid "Your old citizen went with it, with everything it owned, and so did your account. This is the public alpha, and everybody starts again on the same day. You can use the same email address."
msgstr "S njim su nestali tvoj stari građanin i sav njegov imetak, kao i tvoj račun. Ovo je javna alfa i svi počinju ponovo istog dana. Možeš da koristiš istu adresu e-pošte."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.previousWorld.heading"
msgid "The closed alpha world was deleted."
msgstr "Svet zatvorene alfe je obrisan."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.previousWorld.login"
msgid "Played in the closed alpha? Its accounts were deleted with its world. Become a citizen again instead: the link is at the foot of this box."
msgstr "Iz zatvorene alfe? Njeni računi su obrisani zajedno sa njenim svetom. Umesto toga ponovo postani građanin: link je na dnu ovog okvira."

#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "stage.public.previousWorld.refusal"
msgid "If you played in the closed alpha, that account was deleted with its world. Become a citizen again below."
msgstr "Ako imaš račun iz zatvorene alfe, on je obrisan zajedno sa njenim svetom. Ponovo postani građanin ispod."

